// session — the field report was "OCR reaches page 3 or 4 and stays there
// forever", with no error shown and no way out. Every await that touches a
// worker or the renderer is now bounded. A page that exceeds its bound is
// recorded as unread and disclosed like any other unread page; the scan moves
// on. (Extraction completeness has always been device-dependent — the OCR
